    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. To go a bit deeper, could you explain the specific cellular mechanisms behind how leucine helps overcome the inhibition of mTOR? Also, if the caloric surplus is too high, how does that affect the efficiency of that nitrogen retention? I want to make sure I'm giving my client the most optimized advice.",
